{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"]]},"metadata":{"title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","symbolKind":"case","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@E@MLNTextWritingMode@MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement would be laid out horizontally."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal":{"title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement would be laid out horizontally."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode":{"title":"MLNTextWritingMode","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingMode","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The property allows control over a symbol’s orientation. Note that the property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values act as a hint, so that a symbol whose language doesn’t support the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided orientation will be laid out in its natural orientation. Example:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English point symbol will be rendered horizontally even if array value contains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single ‘vertical’ enum value. The order of elements in an array define priority"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order for the placement of an orientation variant."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"}}}